=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F/%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%9C%E4%B8%8E%E5%B9%BB%E6%98%BC\" title=\"晴夜与幻昼\"><img alt=\"晴夜与幻昼\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Item_building-14013.png/100px-Item_building-14013.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Item_building-14013.png/150px-Item_building-14013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e0/Item_building-14013.png/200px-Item_building-14013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E4%BC%91%E8%8D%92%E5%8E%9F/%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%9C%E4%B8%8E%E5%B9%BB%E6%98%BC\" title=\"不休荒原/晴夜与幻昼\">晴夜与幻昼</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">今夜剔透如水晶，任一切面都能折射五光十色的梦境。</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180043.730.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180043.730.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180043.730.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3025/302507/星锑皮肤born.mp4_20260922_180043.730.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“就在今天，伟大的船长星锑……不对，是伟大的主唱兼吉他手星锑，将会从幕后走向台前！”<br />她狠狠地踩下Fuzz踏板，把爵士和金属糅进同一首歌曲，只为唱出内心所想。没有完美的和弦？一段经典的Riff奏响，就让全场的观众High了起来！吉他和演唱的音量有些冲突，人声没有及时后撤？当激情被点燃，一切都要为她的歌喉让位！观众们期待着经典的solo如期登场，她却出人意料地将其改为新锐的变奏，炽烈的旋律直击灵魂，人们高喊着安可，一遍又一遍，直到整个夜晚都沉醉其中。<br />在这个晚上，所有的期许都会被满足。毕竟摇滚的灵魂，是自由。而一个属于摇滚的梦，又怎么会被现实束缚呢？</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302507\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d0/Belonging-302510.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">海盗吉他<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Pirate's Guitar</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一把造型独特的吉他，由铜线、塑料护板、木材等拼接而成。<br />受访者特意为我们展示了她引以为傲的“再创作”——琴面上的唱片贴纸与胡椒博士贴纸。当笔者困惑于这一设计对吉他本身的表现究竟有何影响时，她表现得满不在乎，“这很难解释清楚，朋友。它们改变了这把吉他的灵魂——它来自旧时代，但现在已经是个新玩意儿！”</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/08/Belonging-302511.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">闪烁礼帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Sparkly Hat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />4.9<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶镶嵌着亮片的礼帽，帮助受访者重新诠释“华丽摇滚”的涵义。<br />当我们聊起这顶帽子时，受访者爽快地将它摘下，戴在了笔者的头上，“那些古板的老爷们不会理解这顶帽子的魔力。只要戴上它，今夜你可以摇滚个通宵！”不过，笔者还是礼貌地将帽子还给了这位摇滚吉他手。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Belonging-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“反叛与摇摆”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Swinging Rebellion\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />8.9<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>厚底、中筒、黑皮革……任何自称摇滚乐手的人，恐怕都难以拒绝一双来自北安普敦郡的工装厚底靴，受访者也不例外。<br />她很喜欢穿着它跳扭扭舞，后跟的踢踏声与乐器野兽一般的啸叫声相得益彰。“再来一口胡椒博士，下一步就是宇宙！”她兴奋地搂住了我们的脖子，采访不得不就此中断。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "含有受损文件链接的页面"}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">最强音 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Greatest Chord</small></span></span>"}}